      "solution": "import pandas as pd\n\n\ndef prices(orders, products):\n    df = pd.merge(pd.DataFrame(orders), pd.DataFrame(products), on=\"상품\", how=\"left\")\n    return df[\"가격\"].tolist()\n",
      "time_limit_sec": 15
